    dct:description "Simulates all 6 canonical regimes from Vandenberg et al. (2012) and Pinet et al. (2019) (`wild_type_unperturbed_remodeling`, `picasso_scrambled_craniofacial_closed_loop`, `caudal_lateral_eye_rotation_closed_loop`, `lateral_jaw_mouth_translocation_closed_loop`, `open_loop_fixed_displacement_null`, and `mmp_inhibitor_gm6001_blockade_ablation`), evaluates organ migration speed vs defect distance across 20 landmark trajectories (`r = 0.9495`, Panel B2), and maps the 15x15 (perturbation scale, MMP mobility) morphospace (Panel B3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
