    dct:description "Deterministic execution (`seed=2019`), standalone 8-check `--self-test` suite verifying SHA-256 dataset locks, Lyapunov zero-equilibrium & monotonic decay, all 6 experimental regimes, bilateral symmetry restoration, velocity-distance scaling, specimen bilateral eye CV segmentation, and bitwise two-run determinism (`atol=0.0`), plus rendered 9-panel PNG and 24-frame GIF in `docs/media/`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
